+The method originates from the VektorKnight/vektor-voxels project, a voxel engine implementation using Unity's Job System and Burst Compiler [S1, unofficial]. It was further explored in the context of "Phase 9: Voxel Surface Exploration" for the SolarSystem project, integrating with TSL/WebGPU materials for AAA-style voxel visuals [S2, unofficial].
 
